description.desc:
While under [Crimson Inscription], Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Unleash up to three Slashes forward with the blood axe, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Upon activating the second attack skill, Claret jumps backward and throws the blood axe. Perfect Dodge can be triggered during the retreat;
Upon activating the third attack skill, Claret performs consecutive Slashes before leaping up and slamming down. During the consecutive Slashes, Anti-Interrupt level is increased and DMG taken is reduced by 40%. Hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to extend the duration of the consecutive Slashes. Release <IconMap:Icon_Normal> and Claret will immediately leap up and slam down. Perfect Dodge can be triggered during the leap. After successfully triggering Perfect Dodge, press or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the third sequence of [Basic Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Star Forge];
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during activation.

While under [Scarlet Engrave], after activating [Special Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Jin Severance] or [Special Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Burial Blood Onslaught] and successfully inflicting [Maim], press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Spin-jumps with the blood axe and slams down to Slash the target enemy, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>. Perfect Dodge effects can be triggered during the jump;
After using this skill, press or hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the 3rd hit of [Basic Attack: Blood Bloom Oath - Star Forge];
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Scarlet Engrave]</color> state during activation.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> during a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> to activate:
Unleashes a powerful Counter with the blood axe against enemies ahead, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Does not exit <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> state during activation;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Sharpness is sufficient and not in [Crimson Engrave], press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Transforms the forging hammer into a blood axe and Slashes the target enemy, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
After consuming Sharpness to use the skill, enters [Crimson Engrave] for 12.5 seconds. While off field, the duration no longer decreases;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

While in [Crimson Inscription], press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Performs a powerful upward strike followed by a horizontal Slash, dealing <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
If the horizontal Slash hits an enemy afflicted with [Gash], it inflicts [Maim] on the target, dealing additional <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during activation;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

While in [Crimson Inscription], during [Special Attack: Blood Blossom Oath · Sever Jin and Sunder Steel]'s launch phase, hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Launches 3 consecutive horizontal Slashes forward, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Each horizontal Slash that hits an enemy with [Gash] inflicts [Maim] on the target, dealing additional <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>. This skill can inflict [Maim] up to 3 times; the 3rd [Maim] has a higher Interrupt Level;
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Inscription]</color> state during activation;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased during this skill. After successfully triggering [Maim], Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Unleashes consecutive slashes on enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
While active, <color=#FFFFFF>Crimson Imprint</color> duration no longer decreases, and will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>Crimson Imprint</color> state;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Unleashes a series of slashes on enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
While active, <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> duration stops decreasing, and the character will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> state;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When the active character is launched, press <IconMap:Icon_Switch> to activate:
Deals <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Will not exit <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> state during activation;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> after a <color=#FFFFFF>Defensive Assist</color> to activate:
dealing massive <color=#2EB6FF>Electric DMG</color>;
Will not exit the <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> state during this skill;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When you or the on-field Character is about to be hit by a Control Skill attack, press <IconMap:Icon_Switch> to activate:
Engage in a grapple with the monster. Upon a successful grapple, nullify the enemy's Control Skill;
While active, <color=#FFFFFF>[Crimson Imprint]</color> duration no longer decreases;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

desc:
All DMG dealt by Claret's skills is Sharp DMG, which uses DEF as the skill DMG Multiplier;
When a critical hit is triggered, Laceration DMG replaces CRIT DMG for calculation; when CRIT Rate exceeds 100%, an additional Laceration judgment is performed, with the Laceration probability equal to the excess CRIT Rate;
Sharp DMG accumulates Gash value. When the Gash value is full, the enemy enters [Gash], which can stack up to 3 times;
When Claret enters the battlefield, she recovers 60 Sharpness. In Investigation Zone mode, this effect can trigger once every 180 seconds.
When Claret's [Special Attack: Blood Oath - Sever Steel] or [Special Attack: Blood Oath - Crimson Onslaught] hits an enemy afflicted with [Gash], one stack of [Gash] is consumed, triggering [Maim] to deal additional DMG;
After Claret enters [Crimson Engrave], her Anti-Interrupt Lv. is increased. When Claret uses a [Chain Attack], [Crimson Engrave] duration is extended by 3s. When [Contamination] is triggered, [Crimson Engrave] duration is extended by 3s;
While Claret is in [Crimson Engrave], or during [Chain Attack: Blood Oath - Blood Pact Resonance], [Ultimate: Blood Oath - Thousandfold Temper], or [Assist Follow-Up: Blood Oath - Pristine Molten Edge], DMG dealt is increased by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>15%</color>. During [Basic Attack: Blood Oath - Forge Star] and [Basic Attack: Blood Oath - Descending Axe] skill attacks, triggering a Perfect Dodge additionally increases DMG dealt for the remaining duration of the skill by 15%.

When another character in your squad is a <color=#FFFFFF>[Stun]</color> Character or another <color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Character, triggers:
When a squad member's attack hits an enemy while they are the active Character, accumulates <color=#FFFFFF>3%</color> Gash value on the target, can trigger at most once every 1s;
When Claret or a squad member triggers [Maim], all [Armorer] Agents in the whole squad enter [Remnant Edge]. While in the [Remnant Edge] state, CRIT Rate increases by <color=#FFFFFF>30%</color>, lasting 40s; re-entering [Remnant Edge] extends its duration.

